  "description": "About this item\n\nROBUST DUAL 500W MOTOR- The Gotrax Ares off-road electric scooter boasts dual 500W motors up to 28mph, providing the flexibility of single-wheel or dual-wheel drive. Its formidable power enables effortless ascents of slopes up to 20% and accommodates riders weighing up to 264 pounds with ease.\nFRONT AND REAR DUAL SUSPENSION- The Ares adult electric scooter features a front and rear dual suspension system, combined with 10*2.5-inch wide off-road tires, providing a smoother and more comfortable riding experience while minimizing bumps and vibrations during your journey.\nLONG-RANGE BATTERY- The scooter comes with a built-in 16Ah battery, offering a maximum range of 32 miles. The battery can be quickly installed and removed without screws. Also, equipped with both front and rear EABS and mechanical disc brakes, the scooter ensures a safe ride.\n3 ADJUSTABLE SPEED MODES- The scooter offers 3-speed modes (15.5 MPH, 20 MPH, and 28 MPH) to suit different riding needs. The quick-set buttons allow for easy adjustments of speed units (mph, km/h), enabling/disabling cruise control and password lock function, and setting zero or non-zero start.\nELECTRIC PASSWORD LOCK- The scooter features a built-in 3-digit electronic password lock for added security. The red brake tail light flashes when braking and the bright headlight and ambient lights ensure a safe and enjoyable ride.",
